    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:246ec015febc8b0c060c7d9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんと……栄養管理を共に\\n乗り越えた同室者と、ドーナツを食べます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "801b996c738d3065bc78cdcf784178d0a0f8e765e407f5e49333cd164009cf7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef4acdf4ba0a44b0957d08e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "引擎全开全力冲刺……\\n就像「超跑」一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "794b525760a6fb4f03d25cc954e83b641e2ce316e4b857e431454863e5d34f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6843c94775ab71ebc324d48f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我先说这发色是天生的。不仅显眼还容易\\n在竞赛中被盯上，相当麻烦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "285fdfaf59e126947ec86ec4f49c3ad89bde2ded360b1f46d03543d14ad2eb44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d1a5d8c3bb364d8e558d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "絶対に勝つのだと、誰よりも固く鍛え抜いた\\n鉄のような意志……かと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725fdfb3fb59daf9ad00409071e0205f383b89efa9c05e4c910a025986c65402",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
