    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ad86b0fde5eba416d1a927",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "そ。『未知』を求めて、どこでも行くよん。\\n東にも、西にも、砂漠の国にも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b48b7def8240e69299fcc6dd03ba6e14c73f9674eb97eccb5054d120f99e582",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1b02722cd27887217de94b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もち。記者さんにご紹介するなら……\\n防塵防水カメラか、高音質レコーダーとか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55596ee9b269fa415e2a797e379ded99333bda7794c5d9cf2708813644662ab4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db0b3fb1a72249f5f23ca77c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "え～、そんなガラじゃないんだが～？\\n――でも、譲らないよ。最先端の『未知』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77994492cbc1070c134bd5f4a89a5235335b54d864cb7edcc50cb9b64def67ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264a103f0efa9b2489fece25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "そ。『未知』を求めて、どこでも行くよん。\\n東にも、西にも、砂漠の国にも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b48b7def8240e69299fcc6dd03ba6e14c73f9674eb97eccb5054d120f99e582",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b921f0e2daa91062b37768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もち。記者さんにご紹介するなら……\\n防塵防水カメラか、高音質レコーダーとか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55596ee9b269fa415e2a797e379ded99333bda7794c5d9cf2708813644662ab4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4baa2a0d2ebb4e4a0ed42d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起立！敬礼！我身为你们的班长，\\n会勇敢地跑下去！坐下──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d812f5d0bcfffc800010101b82af42e6b018f4fa2f58f4818177ddbbdf5cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e1dba95d5d620dd34b81dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "え～、そんなガラじゃないんだが～？\\n――でも、譲らないよ。最先端の『未知』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77994492cbc1070c134bd5f4a89a5235335b54d864cb7edcc50cb9b64def67ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
